2026-03-18T00:10:18 [DEBUG] xhtml2pdf.document: pisaDocument options:
  src = b'<!DOCTYPE html>\n<html><head>\n<meta charset="utf-8">\n<style>\n@page { margin: 2.00cm 2.00cm 2.00cm 2.00cm; }\nbody { font-family: Cambria, Georgia, serif; font-size: 12.0pt; margin: 0; color: #000; }\nh1 { font-family: Calibri, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 24.0pt; font-weight: bold; text-align: center; margin: 0; }\nh2 { font-family: Calibri, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 14pt; font-weight: bold; margin: 0; }\np { margin: 0; line-height: 1.15; }\np.spacer { line-height: 1.0; }\np.body-text { }\np.exp-header { font-family: Calibri, Arial, sans-serif; font-weight: bold; }\np.bullet-item { padding-left: 36pt; text-indent: -18pt; }\n</style>\n</head><body>\n<p class="body-text" style="margin-bottom:6.0pt">March 18, 2026</p>\n<p class="body-text" style="margin-bottom:6.0pt">Dear Hiring Manager,</p>\n<p class="body-text" style="margin-bottom:6.0pt">I\xe2\x80\x99m applying for the Senior Software Engineer \xe2\x80\x93 Team Lead role at CARFAX. I\xe2\x80\x99m a Senior Software Engineer with 10+ years of experience building modern web applications with React and TypeScript, plus full-stack delivery with Node.js and Ruby on Rails. Across product teams, I\xe2\x80\x99ve focused on accessible, user-friendly interfaces, component-driven UI architecture, and disciplined testing practices.</p>\n<p class="body-text" style="margin-bottom:6.0pt">CARFAX\xe2\x80\x99s focus on delivering a secure, consistent, high-quality login and profile experience strongly aligns with how I build customer-facing web surfaces: clear UI patterns, reusable components, and quality gates that keep changes safe. In recent work, I delivered reusable React/TypeScript components with Jest/React Testing Library coverage, and built React/TypeScript interfaces alongside Node/Express services for HR case workflows, including permissions-sensitive UI behavior and automated linting/unit-test checks.</p>\n<p class="body-text" style="margin-bottom:6.0pt">I also bring hands-on technical leadership that matches your Team Lead expectations: delegating ownership, using code review to raise quality, coaching engineers through complex work, and pushing back on risky changes that could threaten production stability. Earlier, I re-architected a Rewards platform UI from Rails-rendered views to ReactJS and implemented a modular design system to improve UI consistency.</p>\n<p class="body-text" style="margin-bottom:6.0pt">I\xe2\x80\x99d welcome the opportunity to help CARFAX\xe2\x80\x99s Account Engineering team deliver reliable, user-friendly account experiences and to contribute to a culture of continuous improvement and learning.</p>\n<p class="spacer" style="margin-bottom:6.0pt">&nbsp;</p>\n<p class="spacer" style="margin-bottom:6.0pt">&nbsp;</p>\n<p class="spacer" style="margin-bottom:6.0pt">&nbsp;</p>\n<p class="body-text" style="margin-bottom:6.0pt">Sincerely,</p>\n<p class="body-text" style="margin-bottom:6.0pt">Oli Treadwell</p>\n<p class="spacer">&nbsp;</p>\n</body></html>'
  dest = <_io.BufferedWriter name='/tmp/tmprtbh0nu3.pdf'>
  path = ''
  link_callback = None
  xhtml = False
  context_meta = None
