er role at Acme Corp.</p>\n<p class="body-text" style="margin-bottom:6.0pt">I have built distributed systems for 10+ years.</p>\n<p class="body-text" style="margin-bottom:6.0pt">Thank you.</p>\n<p class="spacer" style="margin-bottom:6.0pt">&nbsp;</p>\n<p class="spacer" style="margin-bottom:6.0pt">&nbsp;</p>\n<p class="spacer" style="margin-bottom:6.0pt">&nbsp;</p>\n<p class="body-text" style="margin-bottom:6.0pt">Sincerely,</p>\n<p class="body-text" style="margin-bottom:6.0pt">Leoind Verman</p>\n<p class="spacer">&nbsp;</p>\n</body></html>'
